     "note": "Lundgren 2021 states the identical recipe (22 mM KH2PO4, 42 mM Na2HPO4, 8.6 mM NaCl, 2.0 mM MgSO4, 5.0 μM FeSO4, pH 7.0) with NO added trace-element solution and NO vitamins, and cites no earlier source for it. Base medium confirmed complete; nothing new to add."
    }
   ],
   "missing_before": [],
   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "This is a fully defined minimal medium with only five salts plus an as-indicated C/N supplement (20 mM D-glucose + 10 mM NH4Cl for the standard condition; the paper also uses 10 mM β-Asp-Arg, 10 mM L-aspartate, or 10 mM L-arginine). Chasing the cited base reference (Lundgren 2021) confirmed there is deliberately NO trace-element mix (only 5 µM FeSO4) and NO vitamins. The Ca2+, Co2+, Cu2+, Mn2+, Zn2+ and Fe3+ entries in the target's current_components are NOT part of the defined recipe (they have no textual source in either the paper or the base reference; trace metals are present only as unqua"
  },
